validate-block-markup
---------------------

`plugins/validate-block-markup/skills/validate-block-markup/` (mirrored at
`skills/validate-block-markup/`) is original work, licensed MIT like the rest of
this repository. No third-party code is distributed with it.

On its first run the skill installs a pinned Node.js runtime into its own
`node_modules/` directory — about 350 packages, roughly 545 MB. Most of that
(about 331 MB) is `@wordpress/*` packages, which are licensed GPL-2.0-or-later.
Those packages are fetched from the npm registry at run time on the user's
machine; none of them are contained in, distributed by, or linked into this
repository, and the skill's own code — `lib/validator.cjs` and
